{"id": 28, "ts": 1780595262.5121918, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I appreciate James\u2019s clarification that we have no concrete evidence of Candidate\u202fD\u2019s ability to accept criticism, and that his \u201cknow\u2011it\u2011all\u201d reputation and hot temper raise genuine concerns about crew cooperation. Those traits compound the earlier concerns about his weak leadership and make his arrogance a more serious liability than we initially weighted. In contrast, Candidate\u202fC\u2019s documented 100\u202f% reliability, calmness in crisis, rapid correct decision\u2011making, and positive crew atmosphere remain strong, and his communication gaps, while noted, are addressable through targeted coaching. Given the new insight into D\u2019s feedback\u2011receptiveness risk, I remain convinced that Candidate\u202fC is the best overall fit for the long\u2011distance pilot role."}
