{"id": 32, "ts": 1780595296.8901134, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I concur with Sarah\u2019s assessment that Candidate\u202fC remains the strongest overall fit. His 100\u202f% reliability, proven calmness in crises, and ability to make rapid correct decisions directly address the core safety and operational criteria for long\u2011distance flights. Moreover, his positive crew atmosphere demonstrates solid cooperation, which is essential for sustained international routes. While his communication gaps and egocentric tendencies are noted, they appear manageable through targeted training and do not outweigh the serious concerns we have about Candidate\u202fD\u2019s \u201cknow\u2011it\u2011all\u201d reputation and hot temper\u2014traits that could jeopardize crew coordination and feedback acceptance. Given this balance, I shift my vote to Candidate\u202fC."}
